---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import WidgetWrapper from '~/components/ui/WidgetWrapper.astro';
import Headline from '~/components/ui/Headline.astro';
import Hero2 from '~/components/widgets/Hero2.astro';
import FAQs from '~/components/widgets/FAQs.astro';
import Timeline from '~/components/ui/Timeline.astro';
import simplePattern from '~/assets/images/patterns/simple.svg';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Metal Roofing Hawaii & Oahu | R&C Roofing Contractors',
  description:
    'Explore metal roofing for Oahu homes and properties. Learn what to consider for coastal exposure, roof design, cost, installation, and material selection with R&C Roofing.',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>

  <!-- P-01 · Hero -->
  <Hero2
    actions={[{ variant: 'primary', text: 'Discuss a Metal Roofing Project', href: '/contact' }]}
    image={{
      src: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80',
      alt: 'Metal roofing on an Oahu property',
    }}
  >
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Metal Roofing<br />on Oahu
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="subtitle">
      <span class="block text-[20px] md:text-[24px] font-medium font-heading text-heading mb-6 leading-[130%] tracking-tight">
        Is a Metal Roof Right for Your Property?
      </span>
      Metal roofing can be a strong option for a new roof or replacement project, but choosing "metal" is only the beginning. The type of metal, panel system, finish, roof design, property location, and installation details all matter — especially on Oahu, where properties can experience very different levels of coastal exposure, rainfall, wind, and sun.
      <br /><br />
      R&amp;C Roofing Contractors can evaluate your property and help you determine whether a metal roofing system fits the roof, project goals, and budget.
      <br /><br />
    R&amp;C operates under Hawaii contractor license C-33642.
  </Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="bg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[6%]"
        style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</Hero2>

  <!-- Is Metal Roofing a Good Fit? · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="Is Metal Roofing a Good Fit for You?" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">
      Metal roofing may be worth considering when you are planning a larger roof investment and want to compare it carefully with other roofing systems. There is no roofing material that is automatically right for every home or commercial building.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">
          Metal Roofing May Be Worth Considering If
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'You want a different roofing system from traditional asphalt shingles.',
            'You like the appearance of metal panels or profiles.',
            'You are planning a long-term roof replacement or new construction project.',
            'You are willing to compare metal type, finish, and system details rather than choosing on appearance alone.',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">
          Look Closely at Other Options If
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'The initial project budget is your main deciding factor.',
            'The existing roof or structure creates complications for the proposed system.',
            'Another material better fits the architecture or goals of the property.',
            'The specific metal system available is not appropriate for the property\'s exposure or roof design.',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <a href="/services/roofing-materials" class="btn btn-secondary">Compare Roofing Materials</a>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- What Is Metal Roofing? · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-white mb-8 md:mb-10">
      What Is Metal Roofing?
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70 space-y-5">
      <p>"Metal roofing" describes a category of roofing systems rather than one single product. Metal roofs can differ in the metal used, panel profile, attachment method, finish, coating, and other system details. Those differences can affect appearance and how the roofing system performs in a particular environment.</p>
      <p>Industry guidance also treats material, coatings, and fastener compatibility as important parts of metal-roof selection. That is why it is important to evaluate the specific roofing system rather than assuming that all metal roofs are the same.</p>
      <p>R&amp;C can review the metal roofing options available for your project and explain the differences that matter for the property.</p>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[8%]"
          style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Metal Roofing and Oahu Conditions · white bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="Metal Roofing and Oahu Conditions" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">
      The property's location should be part of the metal-roofing decision. Oahu's range of environments makes material and system selection especially important.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      {[
        {
          title: 'Coastal Exposure',
          description:
            'Properties near the ocean require careful consideration of the metal, finish, fasteners, flashing, and other exposed components. Different metals and coatings offer different levels of corrosion resistance. Industry guidance identifies aluminum for greater corrosion resistance in marine environments, though the complete system and property exposure still need to be evaluated.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Wind Exposure',
          description:
            'Roof shape, building height, location, surrounding terrain, panel system, and attachment details can all matter when a metal roof is designed for a wind-exposed property. The appropriate requirements should be determined for the specific project rather than relying on a generic claim.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Rainfall and Roof Details',
          description:
            'Metal panels are only one part of the water-management system. Flashing, penetrations, transitions, roof edges, drainage, and installation details remain important wherever rainfall is a concern.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Sun and Finish Selection',
          description:
            'Metal roofing is available with different finishes and coatings. Finish selection can affect appearance and weathering over time, so the specific product should be considered when comparing systems.',
        },
      ].map(({ title, description }) => (
        <div class="intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-3">{title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] md:text-[15px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white dark:bg-transparent"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Advantages and Tradeoffs · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="Advantages and Tradeoffs of Metal Roofing" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">
      We would rather help you understand both sides of the decision than present metal as the perfect roof for every property.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">Potential Advantages</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'Available in a range of profiles and finishes',
            'Can be used for residential and commercial applications',
            'Certain systems can provide a long service life when properly specified and installed',
            'Different metals allow properties with different exposure conditions to be considered',
            'Creates a distinct architectural appearance',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">Considerations</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'Product and system selection can be more complex than simply choosing a color',
            'Initial project cost may be higher than some other roofing options',
            'Lifespan varies by metal, coating, environment, system, installation, and maintenance',
            'Coastal properties require particular attention to corrosion resistance and component compatibility',
            'Metal may not be the preferred aesthetic for every property',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- How Long Does a Metal Roof Last? · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-white mb-8 md:mb-10">
      How Long Does a Metal Roof Last?
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70 space-y-5 mb-8">
      <p>There is no responsible single lifespan number that applies to every metal roof. Service life can vary based on several factors.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:gap-4">
      {[
        'The metal used',
        'Coating or finish',
        'Roofing system',
        'Property exposure',
        'Installation',
        'Maintenance',
        'Roof details and penetrations',
        'Condition of other components in the roofing assembly',
      ].map((item) => (
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
          <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[8%]"
          style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- What Does Metal Roofing Cost on Oahu? · white bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-heading">
        What Does Metal Roofing Cost on Oahu?
      </h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary shrink-0">Request an Estimate</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted mb-8 md:mb-10">
      Metal roof pricing depends on much more than square footage. R&amp;C can provide project-specific pricing after evaluating the property and proposed metal roofing system.
    </p>
    <div class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
      {[
        {
          title: 'Metal and Roofing System',
          description: 'Different metals, profiles, coatings, and panel systems have different material and installation requirements.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Roof Size and Design',
          description: 'Roof slope, valleys, penetrations, transitions, and architectural complexity can affect the amount of material and labor required.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Existing Roof Condition',
          description: 'For a replacement project, the condition of the current roofing system and underlying components may affect the scope.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Property Access',
          description: 'Building height, staging requirements, and access around the property can influence installation.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Roofing Details',
          description: 'Flashing, edges, penetrations, drainage, and other project-specific details can add to the scope.',
        },
      ].map(({ title, description }) => (
        <div class="py-6 md:py-8 flex flex-col intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-2">{title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white dark:bg-transparent"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- What Does Metal Roof Installation Involve? · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-heading">
        What Does Metal Roof Installation Involve?
      </h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary shrink-0">Plan Your Metal Roof</a>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16">
      <div class="md:basis-1/2 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
          <p>Every project is different, but the planning process generally starts before any roofing material is ordered. R&amp;C evaluates the property first, then develops the roofing scope based on what the project actually requires.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:basis-1/2">
        <Timeline
          items={[
            {
              title: 'Evaluate the Property',
              description: 'R&C reviews the existing roof when applicable, property conditions, roof design, and project goals.',
              icon: 'tabler:search',
            },
            {
              title: 'Review the Metal Roofing Options',
              description: 'Available roofing systems can be considered based on the building and project requirements.',
              icon: 'tabler:template',
            },
            {
              title: 'Develop the Roofing Scope',
              description: 'The proposed system, roof details, existing conditions, and necessary project work are incorporated into the scope.',
              icon: 'tabler:file-description',
            },
            {
              title: 'Prepare the Roof',
              description: 'For a replacement, the existing roofing system is addressed according to the agreed project requirements. Conditions discovered during this stage may affect the work needed.',
              icon: 'tabler:tool',
            },
            {
              title: 'Install the Metal Roofing System',
              description: 'R&C completes the agreed installation according to the project specifications and applicable requirements.',
              icon: 'tabler:home-check',
            },
            {
              title: 'Complete the Project',
              description: 'The roofing work moves through the applicable finishing, cleanup, and project-completion steps.',
              icon: 'tabler:check',
            },
          ]}
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Can You Replace Asphalt Shingles With Metal Roofing? · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-white mb-8 md:mb-10">
      Can You Replace Asphalt Shingles With Metal Roofing?
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70 space-y-5 mb-8">
      <p>Potentially. Changing from one roofing material to another should be evaluated as part of the entire replacement project. R&amp;C can look at the existing roof, structure, roof design, and proposed metal system before recommending whether the change is appropriate.</p>
      <p>Do not assume that because metal roofing can be installed on one property, the same approach applies to every roof.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/services/roof-replacement-and-new-installation" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md border-2 border-accent text-white font-semibold text-[15px] leading-snug hover:bg-accent hover:text-black transition-colors duration-200">Explore Roof Replacement &amp; New Installation</a>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[8%]"
          style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Metal Roofing for Homes and Commercial Properties · white bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="Metal Roofing for Homes and Commercial Properties" classes={{ container: 'mb-10 md:mb-14' }} />
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      {[
        {
          title: 'Residential Metal Roofing',
          description: 'Metal can create a distinctive appearance for a home and may be considered for both replacement and new construction projects. R&C can help homeowners compare metal with asphalt shingles, stone-coated steel, tile, and other available roofing options.',
          href: '/services/residential-roofing',
          linkText: 'Explore Residential Roofing',
        },
        {
          title: 'Commercial Metal Roofing',
          description: 'Metal roofing may also be used on commercial buildings depending on the roof design and system being specified. R&C can review commercial metal-roofing needs in the context of the larger property or construction project.',
          href: '/services/commercial-roofing',
          linkText: 'Explore Commercial Roofing',
        },
      ].map(({ title, description, href, linkText }) => (
        <div class="intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-3">{title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] md:text-[15px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted mb-4">{description}</p>
          <a href={href} class="text-primary font-medium text-[14px] md:text-[15px] hover:underline">{linkText} →</a>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white dark:bg-transparent"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- See Metal Roofing on Real Oahu Properties · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="See Metal Roofing on Real Oahu Properties" classes={{ container: 'mb-8 md:mb-12' }} />
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6">
      {[
        {
          neighborhood: '[Neighborhood]',
          system: '[Metal Roofing System]',
          property: '[Verified property type]',
          project: '[Verified replacement or new installation]',
          description: '[Short description of why this roofing system was selected and what R&C completed.]',
        },
        {
          neighborhood: '[Neighborhood]',
          system: '[Metal Roofing System]',
          property: '[Verified property type]',
          project: '[Verified project scope]',
          description: '[Short verified project description.]',
        },
        {
          neighborhood: '[Neighborhood]',
          system: '[Metal Roofing System]',
          property: '[Verified property type]',
          project: '[Verified project scope]',
          description: '[Short verified project description.]',
        },
      ].map(({ neighborhood, system, project, description }) => (
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-4">
          <div class="w-full h-40 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded mb-3 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 dark:text-slate-600">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] md:text-[14px] font-medium text-white/60 mb-1">{neighborhood} | {system}</p>
          <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold font-heading text-white mb-1">Project: {project}</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] md:text-[14px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 md:mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/gallery" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md border-2 border-black text-black font-semibold text-[15px] leading-snug hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">View More Roofing Projects</a>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- How Does Metal Compare With Other Roofing Materials? · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <Headline title="How Does Metal Compare With Other Roofing Materials?" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6', title: 'text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] text-white' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70">
      If you are still deciding, use the Roofing Materials guide to compare the broader options available.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      {[
        {
          title: 'Asphalt Shingles',
          description: 'A familiar residential roofing system with a wide range of product and style choices.',
